{1}{Greetings, brother.}{Greetings, sister.}{}{}{}{ }
{2}{Brother?}{1}{5}{rp1001, lf1 0}{20}{lf1 1 }
{3}{Sister?}{0}{5}{rp1001, lf1 0}{20}{lf1 1 }
{4}{I no your brother!}{1}{-4}{rp1001, lf1 0}{0}{lf1 1, fl 158}
{5}{I no your sister!}{0}{-4}{rp1001, lf1 0}{0}{lf1 1, fl 158}
{6}{Greetings. May I ask your name?}{}{5}{rp-1001, lf1 0}{160}{lf1 1 }
{7}{Who you?}{}{-4}{rp-1001, lf1 0}{0}{lf1 1, fl 158}
{8}{It is done. I have turned Frederik in for you.}{}{5}{gf2638 1}{100}{qu1157 4 }
{9}{I haven't finished your task yet.}{}{5}{gf2638 0, qu1157 2}{0}{lf1 1, fl 159}
{10}{What would I need to plant on your "friend"?}{}{5}{qu1157 1, gf2638 0}{90}{qu1157 2 }
{11}{There were some "complications" with what you wanted me to do.}{}{5}{qu1157 6}{140}{ }
{12}{Last we spoke, you seemed distressed. Is there something wrong?}{}{5}{lf2 1, qu1157 0}{40}{ }
{13}{Can I help even the score with the fellow that betrayed you?}{}{5}{lf3 1, qu1157 0}{70}{ }
{19}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{ }
{20}{Of course! We are all of the Thieves Underground! How goes your travels, friend?}{Of course! We are all of the Thieves Underground! How goes your travels, friend?}{}{}{}{ }
{21}{Adventurous, to say the least. And you?}{}{5}{}{30}{ }
{30}{Sadly, not well. Our fortunes have taken a turn for the worse. [He holds his arms out.] It is this world. I fear I know longer understand it. There used to be honor among thieves, and one could use his natural talents for good...no longer, it seems. Somehow thieves have become no better than common bandits in the eyes of the world.}{Sadly, not well. Our fortunes have taken a turn for the worse. [He holds his arms out.] It is this world. I fear I know longer understand it. There used to be honor among thieves, and one could use his natural talents for good...no longer, it seems. Somehow thieves have become no better than common bandits in the eyes of the world.}{}{}{}{ }
{31}{You seem distressed. What is the matter?}{}{5}{}{40}{ }
{39}{It is sad. I must be on my way, though. Good bye.}{}{5}{}{0}{lf2 1 }
{40}{As I said, I remember when there was honor among thieves...we have been betrayed, my brother. We were doing a job for someone we trusted...not only were we lied to about what it was we were doing, but when the guards got wind of it, we were offered up as a way to save our "friends" sorry hide!}{As I said, I remember when there was honor among thieves...we have been betrayed, my sister. We were doing a job for someone we trusted...not only were we lied to about what it was we were doing, but when the guards got wind of it, we were offered up as a way to save our "friends" sorry hide!}{}{}{}{ }
{41}{Please, go on.}{}{5}{}{50}{ }
{50}{We were told we were recovering some treasures for a museum, previously stolen by a some bottom dweller from Tarant. We stole the items from his room in the Roseborough in, easy as could be. The only problem was that it wasn't international intrigue we were involved in, it was petty theft from some rich tourists.}{We were told we were recovering some treasures for a museum, previously stolen by a some bottom dweller from Tarant. We stole the items from his room in the Roseborough in, easy as could be. The only problem was that it wasn't international intrigue we were involved in, it was petty theft from some rich tourists.}{}{}{}{ }
{51}{And your "friend"?}{}{5}{}{60}{ }
{60}{Ironically, he was the one who hired us in the first place. He lives in Roseborough, though, and I suppose the Captain of the Guard knows him as an "undesirable", as the law has begun terming those of our kind. When the theft was reported, he was the first to be questioned. He turned us in without a second thought. So he goes free, and we are hold up in this cave.}{Ironically, he was the one who hired us in the first place. He lives in Roseborough, though, and I suppose the Captain of the Guard knows him as an "undesirable", as the law has begun terming those of our kind. When the theft was reported, he was the first to be questioned. He turned us in without a second thought. So he goes free, and we are hold up in this cave.}{}{}{}{ }
{61}{Is there some way I could help you even the score, perhaps?}{}{5}{}{70}{ }
{69}{This is fascinating, but I must be going. Good bye.}{}{5}{}{0}{lf3 1 }
{70}{That would be much appreciated, friend. [He thinks for a moment.] There is one way...if you could plant something on him, and then report him to the Captain of the Guard in Roseborough, it would clear our name. Not to mention giving him the reward he deserves. I would pay you 500 coins for your trouble.}{That would be much appreciated, friend. [He thinks for a moment.] There is one way...if you could plant something on him, and then report him to the Captain of the Guard in Roseborough, it would clear our name. Not to mention giving him the reward he deserves. I would pay you 500 coins for your trouble.}{}{}{}{qu1157 1 }
{71}{Okay, I'll do it. What would you have me plant on him?}{}{5}{}{90}{qu1157 2 }
{72}{I am not much for thieving, how about I simply kill him?}{}{5}{}{80}{ }
{79}{I am not interested, at the moment. I will think it over. Good bye.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{80}{No, no, that would not do at all. That would be most dishonorable, even if he has no honor himself.}{No, no, that would not do at all. That would be most dishonorable, even if he has no honor himself.}{}{}{}{ }
{81}{Okay, I'll do it. What would you have me plant on him?}{}{5}{}{90}{qu1157 2 }
{89}{Well, then my talents would be wasted here. Good bye.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{90}{Here. [He shows you an old statue.] This would not only do the trick, it would be poetic justice. Frederik not only turned us in, he was able to make off with most of the valuables from the robbery. This statue is an old family heirloom of the tourists we robbed. It is virtually worthless, but enough to convince the local law Frederik was involved. [He hands it to you.]}{Here. [He shows you an old statue.] This would not only do the trick, it would be poetic justice. Frederik not only turned us in, he was able to make off with most of the valuables from the robbery. This statue is an old family heirloom of the tourists we robbed. It is virtually worthless, but enough to convince the local law Frederik was involved. [He hands it to you.]}{}{}{}{in-5696 }
{91}{Where can I find this Frederik?}{}{5}{gf2636 0}{0}{fl 95}
{92}{Frederik? From Roseborough? I, uh, killed him...}{}{5}{gf2636 1}{110}{ }
{93}{Where can I find this Frederik?}{}{5}{gf2636 1}{0}{qu1157 6, fl 95}
{95}{He lives in Roseborough. Most times you can find him drinking it up inside the Inn, at the bar.}{He lives in Roseborough. Most times you can find him drinking it up inside the Inn, at the bar.}{}{}{}{ }
{100}{Wonderful! That will teach him to dishonor his business associates! Here is the payment I promised you.}{Wonderful! That will teach him to dishonor his business associates! Here is the payment I promised you.}{}{}{}{$$500 }
{101}{A:}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{110}{Oh, that is most distressing. How did it happen?}{Oh, that is most distressing. How did it happen?}{}{}{}{ }
{111}{It was an unfortunate accident. He left me no choice.}{}{5}{}{120}{ }
{112}{I didn't like him, so I killed him for the sheer joy of it.}{}{5}{}{0}{lf5 1, re-20, qu1157 6, fl 130}
{120}{Well, I suppose he got what he deserved. Here's some money for your offer to help us out, anyway.}{Well, I suppose he got what he deserved. Here's some money for your offer to help us out, anyway.}{}{}{}{$$300, qu1157 6, lf6 1 }
{121}{A:}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{130}{You dog! You are no better than he was! I have nothing more to say to you!}{You wench! You are no better than he was! I have nothing more to say to you!}{}{}{}{ }
{140}{Complications? What do you mean?}{Complications? What do you mean?}{}{}{}{ }
{141}{I, uh, killed Frederik...}{}{5}{gf2636 1}{110}{ }
{142}{There was, uh, death involved...I would rather not speak of it.}{}{5}{}{150}{ }
{150}{Understood. Well, I thank you for your attempted help, at the least. Here is a few coins for your trouble.}{Understood. Well, I thank you for your attempted help, at the least. Here is a few coins for your trouble.}{}{}{}{$$150, lf6 1 }
{151}{A:}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{158}{Oh, how sad. A simpleton. On your way, there is nothing for you here.}{Oh, how sad. A simpleton. On your way, there is nothing for you here.}{}{}{}{ }
{159}{Well, let me know when you do.}{Well, let me know when you do.}{}{}{}{ }
{160}{I am known as Renzo. And you are?}{I am known as Renzo. And you are?}{}{}{}{ }
{161}{I am known as @pcname@.}{}{5}{}{170}{ }
